    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13785" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποσπεύδω</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-σπεύσω,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be zealous in preventing,
				dissuade earnestly,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν συμβολήν</span> the engagement, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				6.109
			</span></i>: c.acc. et inf., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ξέρξεα στρατεύεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					7.17
				</span></i>
			: abs., opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπισπεύδω,</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.29
			</span></i>.</div>
